# EyeBreak - Git Ignore Rules
# Keep source code and build scripts, ignore intermediate artifacts, temp files, and build output

# ---- Build Output ----
build/   
dist/

# ---- Debug/Logging ----
eyebreak.log
build_output*.txt
_final_build*.txt

# ---- IDE / Editor ----
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.vcxproj*
*.filters
*.sln

# ---- Operating System ----
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---- Temporary Files ----
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# ---- Documentation ----
REQUIREMENTS.md